al household basket estimate for a 4-person family is PKR 38,255.\";s:14:\"comparisonText\";s:95:\"Estimated ration cost for a 4-person family is broadly unchanged from the previous calculation.\";s:13:\"helperContent\";a:3:{i:0;a:2:{s:7:\"heading\";s:37:\"What a 4-person ration estimate means\";s:4:\"body\";s:223:\"This page translates a household-sized grocery basket into a monthly planning figure. It is not pretending to be an official CPI release. It is a practical budgeting estimate that gives families a quick number to work from.\";}i:1;a:2:{s:7:\"heading\";s:31:\"How the planning margin is used\";s:4:\"body\";s:216:\"Roznamcha applies a visible planning margin so ration planning does not rely on unrealistically neat numbers. That matters when staples move quickly and a family wants a safer range instead of a single fragile total.\";}i:2;a:2:{s:7:\"heading\";s:28:\"How to turn this into action\";s:4:\"body\";s:199:\"Use the current estimate of PKR 38,255 as your working ceiling, then compare it with the previous update before deciding whether to reduce impulse grocery spend or rebalance other monthly categories.\";}}s:13:\"internalLinks\";a:6:{i:0;a:2:{s:5:\"title\";s:36:\"Ration cost for 6 people in Pakistan\";s:4:\"href\";s:34:\"/ration-cost-for-6-people-pakistan\";}i:1;a:2:{s:5:\"title\";s:36:\"Ration cost for 8 people in Pakistan\";s:4:\"href\";s:34:\"/ration-cost-for-8-people-pakistan\";}i:2;a:2:{s:5:\"title\";s:11:\"Kharcha Map\";s:4:\"href\";s:12:\"/kharcha-map\";}i:3;a:2:{s:5:\"title\";s:21:\"Ration Cost Estimator\";s:4:\"href\";s:28:\"/tools/ration-cost-estimator\";}i:4;a:2:{s:5:\"title\";s:26:\"Electricity Bill Estimator\";s:4:\"href\";s:33:\"/tools/electricity-bill-estimator\";}i:5;a:2:{s:5:\"title\";s:15:\"Survival Report\";s:4:\"href\";s:16:\"/survival-report\";}}s:8:\"faqItems\";a:3:{i:0;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:51:\"Is this the exact grocery bill for every household?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:146:\"No. It is an internal planning estimate built for a typical household basket and includes a planning margin so families get a safer budget number.\";}i:1;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:49:\"Why is there a range instead of one strict price?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:150:\"Staple prices move between neighborhoods, timing windows, and purchase quality. A range is more practical than pretending one price fits every basket.\";}i:2;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:50:\"Can I calculate ration for different family sizes?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:142:\"Yes. You can customize any household size, dietary preferences, and basket proportions directly in our interactive Ration Cost Estimator tool.\";}}s:7:\"ctaText\";s:141:\"Save a cleaner monthly grocery plan inside Roznamcha so ration spikes can be compared against rent, utilities, and school costs in one place.\";s:11:\"breadcrumbs\";a:2:{i:0;a:2:{s:5:\"label\";s:4:\"Home\";s:4:\"href\";s:21:\"https://roznamcha.pk/\";}i:1;a:2:{s:5:\"label\";s:36:\"Ration Cost for 4 People in Pakistan\";s:4:\"href\";s:54:\"https://roznamcha.pk/ration-cost-for-4-people-pakistan\";}}s:14:\"structuredData\";a:3:{i:0;a:7:{s:8:\"@context\";s:18:\"https://schema.org\";s:5:\"@type\";s:7:\"WebPage\";s:4:\"name\";s:36:\"Ration Cost for 4 People in Pakistan\";s:3:\"url\";s:54:\"https://roznamcha.pk/ration-cost-for-4-people-pakistan\";s:11:\"description\";s:78:\"Latest internal household basket estimate for a 4-person family is PKR 38,255.\";s:12:\"dateModified\";s:25:\"2026-03-29T12:08:27+00:00\";s:8:\"isPartOf\";a:3:{s:5:\"@type\";s:7:\"WebSite\";s:4:\"name\";s:9:\"Roznamcha\";s:3:\"url\";s:21:\"https://roznamcha.pk/\";}}i:1;a:3:{s:8:\"@context\";s:18:\"https://schema.org\";s:5:\"@type\";s:14:\"BreadcrumbList\";s:15:\"itemListElement\";a:2:{i:0;a:4:{s:5:\"@type\";s:8:\"ListItem\";s:8:\"position\";i:1;s:4:\"name\";s:4:\"Home\";s:4:\"item\";s:21:\"https://roznamcha.pk/\";}i:1;a:4:{s:5:\"@type\";s:8:\"ListItem\";s:8:\"position\";i:2;s:4:\"name\";s:36:\"Ration Cost for 4 People in Pakistan\";s:4:\"item\";s:54:\"https://roznamcha.pk/ration-